@baseUrl = https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com
@userId = 1

### Get All Posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts
Accept: application/json

### Get Single Post
# @name getPost
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{userId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Post Comments
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{getPost.response.body.$[0].id}}/comments
Accept: application/json

### Create New Post
# @name createPost
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Post from HTTP Client",
  "body": "This is a test post created using the REST client",
  "userId": {{userId}}
}

### Update Post
PUT {{baseUrl}}/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Updated Title",
  "body": "Updated content",
  "userId": {{userId}}
}

### Delete Post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/1

### Get Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Accept: application/json

### Get User Albums
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/albums
Accept: application/json

### Get Todos
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos?userId={{userId}}
Accept: application/json

